  "goodToKnow": "Die Transaktion is a transaction, especially financial: eine Transaktion durchführen, bestätigen. Banks must report suspicious Transaktionen under money-laundering rules. Germans have traditionally loved cash (Bargeld), though card and mobile payments grew fast after the pandemic. Die Überweisung is a bank transfer, and die Lastschrift a direct debit. Plural: die Transaktionen."
